            "content": "# Chapter 8: Review and Reflection\n\n# Review Questions\n\n1. Explain the role of the first half as one connected framework in this chapter.\n\n2. Explain the role of data and information in this chapter.\n\n3. Explain the role of databases and dbms concepts in this chapter.\n\n4. Explain the role of tables, keys, and relationships in this chapter.\n\n5. Explain the role of sql and query logic in this chapter.\n\n6. Explain the role of normalization and data quality in this chapter.\n\n7. Explain the role of why this review matters in this chapter.\n\n8. Explain the role of what to review before the midterm in this chapter.\n\n# Reflection Questions\n\n9. Which idea from this chapter is most useful for the Grading Database project?\n\n10. What would you ask for help with before applying this chapter in practice?",
