            "id": "ch16-introduction-page-1",
            "slug": "introduction-page-1",
            "title": "Chapter 16: Final Integration",
            "navTitle": "Chapter 16: Final Integration",
            "content": "# Chapter 16: Final Integration\n\nThe final chapter brings the course together. Across the semester, you learned how to move from raw data to structured tables, from tables to relationships, from relationships to SQL queries, from queries to analytics, and from analytics to decisions. This chapter prepares you for the two final assessments: the Final Project, where you complete and document your own grading database in Microsoft Access, and the Final Test, where you analyze a separate research-publications database and answer conceptual and query-based questions.\n\n## Chapter Video\n\n> **Video placeholder:** Chapter 16 overview video will be added here before publication.\n\n# Chapter Roadmap\n\n| Topic | Why It Matters |\n| --- | --- |\n| [16.3 Final Project Tasks](#16-3-final-project-tasks) | Key topic in this chapter's Core Concepts reading. |\n| [16.4 Project SQL Guidance and Common Pitfalls](#16-4-project-sql-guidance-and-common-pitfalls) | Key topic in this chapter's Core Concepts reading. |\n| [Part II: The Final Test](#part-ii-the-final-test) | Key topic in this chapter's Core Concepts reading. |\n| [16.5 Final Test Overview: The Research Publications Database](#16-5-final-test-overview-the-research-publications-database) | Key topic in this chapter's Core Concepts reading. |\n| [16.6 Publication Scoring Logic](#16-6-publication-scoring-logic) | Key topic in this chapter's Core Concepts reading. |\n| [16.7 Building the Core Test Queries](#16-7-building-the-core-test-queries) | Key topic in this chapter's Core Concepts reading. |\n| [16.8 Final Test Question Map](#16-8-final-test-question-map) | Key topic in this chapter's Core Concepts reading. |\n| [16.9 Final Test Study Strategy](#16-9-final-test-study-strategy) | Key topic in this chapter's Core Concepts reading. |\n| [16.10 Submission and Quality Checklist](#16-10-submission-and-quality-checklist) | Key topic in this chapter's Core Concepts reading. |\n| [16.11 Final Reflection: What This Course Was Really About](#16-11-final-reflection-what-this-course-was-really-about) | Key topic in this chapter's Core Concepts reading. |\n\n---",
            "pageNumber": 1,
            "totalPages": 1,
            "chapterId": "ch16",
            "chapterSlug": "ch16-final-review",
