    "title": "Chapter 10: Advanced SQL for Business Analysis",
    "navTitle": "Chapter 10: Advanced SQL for Business Analysis",
    "content": "# Chapter 10: Advanced SQL for Business Analysis\n\n*Figure 10.1 — Advanced SQL acts as a bridge from clean, normalized storage to reporting and decisions.*\n\nChapter 5 introduced SQL as the language of relational databases. Chapter 9 showed how to design databases from requirements. This chapter returns to SQL with a more advanced goal: using queries to diagnose data problems, restructure messy data into clean normalized tables, connect those tables, calculate meaningful metrics, and create reusable reporting logic.\n\n## Chapter Video\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/kFlSsAMlYTU\" title=\"Chapter 10 overview video\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n[Watch the Chapter 10 overview video](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kFlSsAMlYTU)\n\n# Chapter Roadmap\n\n| Topic | Why It Matters |\n| --- | --- |\n| [10.1 From Basic SQL to Advanced SQL](#10-1-from-basic-sql-to-advanced-sql) | Key topic in this chapter's Core Concepts reading. |\n| [10.2 Grading Database Refresher](#10-2-grading-database-refresher) | Key topic in this chapter's Core Concepts reading. |\n| [10.3 Diagnosing and Restructuring Data with SQL](#10-3-diagnosing-and-restructuring-data-with-sql) | Key topic in this chapter's Core Concepts reading. |\n| [10.4 Advanced JOIN Patterns](#10-4-advanced-join-patterns) | Key topic in this chapter's Core Concepts reading. |\n| [10.5 Cleaning and Conditional Functions](#10-5-cleaning-and-conditional-functions) | Key topic in this chapter's Core Concepts reading. |\n| [10.6 Analytical Aggregation](#10-6-analytical-aggregation) | Key topic in this chapter's Core Concepts reading. |\n| [10.7 Date and Time Queries](#10-7-date-and-time-queries) | Key topic in this chapter's Core Concepts reading. |\n| [10.8 Weighted Grades and Policy Tables](#10-8-weighted-grades-and-policy-tables) | Key topic in this chapter's Core Concepts reading. |\n| [10.9 Window Functions](#10-9-window-functions) | Key topic in this chapter's Core Concepts reading. |\n| [10.10 Reusable Reporting Pipelines](#10-10-reusable-reporting-pipelines) | Key topic in this chapter's Core Concepts reading. |\n\n---",
    "pageNumber": 1,
    "totalPages": 1,
    "chapterId": "ch10",
    "chapterSlug": "ch10-advanced-sql-queries",
