    "navTitle": "Chapter 13: Advanced Database Techniques",
    "content": "# Chapter 13: Advanced Database Techniques\n\nEarlier chapters focused on making databases correct: designing tables, defining keys, normalizing data, writing SQL, administering systems, and using data for business intelligence. But in real organizations, correctness is only the beginning — a database also has to survive real use. This chapter introduces the advanced techniques that turn a working database into a more reliable system: indexes, transactions, constraints, triggers, window functions, security, and platform differences, applied to hardening the Grading Database.\n\n## Chapter Video\n\n> **Video placeholder:** Chapter 13 overview video will be added here before publication.\n\n# Chapter Roadmap\n\n| Topic | Why It Matters |\n| --- | --- |\n| [13.1 From Correct Queries to Reliable Systems](#13-1-from-correct-queries-to-reliable-systems) | Key topic in this chapter's Core Concepts reading. |\n| [13.1.1 What Advanced Techniques Protect](#13-1-1-what-advanced-techniques-protect) | Key topic in this chapter's Core Concepts reading. |\n| [13.1.2 The Idea of Database Hardening](#13-1-2-the-idea-of-database-hardening) | Key topic in this chapter's Core Concepts reading. |\n| [13.2 Indexes: Making Queries Fast at Scale](#13-2-indexes-making-queries-fast-at-scale) | Key topic in this chapter's Core Concepts reading. |\n| [13.2.1 Why Performance Problems Appear Late](#13-2-1-why-performance-problems-appear-late) | Key topic in this chapter's Core Concepts reading. |\n| [13.2.2 What an Index Does](#13-2-2-what-an-index-does) | Key topic in this chapter's Core Concepts reading. |\n| [13.2.3 Creating Indexes](#13-2-3-creating-indexes) | Key topic in this chapter's Core Concepts reading. |\n| [13.2.4 Composite Indexes](#13-2-4-composite-indexes) | Key topic in this chapter's Core Concepts reading. |\n| [13.2.5 Unique Indexes](#13-2-5-unique-indexes) | Key topic in this chapter's Core Concepts reading. |\n| [13.2.6 The Cost of Indexes](#13-2-6-the-cost-of-indexes) | Key topic in this chapter's Core Concepts reading. |\n\n---",
    "pageNumber": 1,
    "totalPages": 1,
