    "id": "ch15-introduction-page-1",
    "slug": "introduction-page-1",
    "title": "Chapter 15: Business Strategy and Information Systems",
    "navTitle": "Chapter 15: Business Strategy and Information Systems",
    "content": "# Chapter 15: Business Strategy and Information Systems\n\nThis chapter connects the technical and analytical skills built throughout the course to business strategy. It covers competitive advantage through IT, Porter's Five Forces, the value chain, the Resource-Based View, strategic IS alignment, governance, and the risks of weak information strategy. It shows how database design, BI, and analytics are not just technical choices — they are strategic ones, and how the skills you developed across Chapters 1-13 converge into one question: how does an information system help us win?\n\n## Chapter Video\n\n> **Video placeholder:** Chapter 15 overview video will be added here before publication.\n\n# Chapter Roadmap\n\n| Topic | Why It Matters |\n| --- | --- |\n| [15.3 Competitive Advantage and IS Frameworks](#15-3-competitive-advantage-and-is-frameworks) | Key topic in this chapter's Core Concepts reading. |\n| [15.4 Strategy Requires Analytics](#15-4-strategy-requires-analytics) | Key topic in this chapter's Core Concepts reading. |\n| [15.5 Advanced SQL as Strategic Capability](#15-5-advanced-sql-as-strategic-capability) | Key topic in this chapter's Core Concepts reading. |\n| [15.6 Strategic Alignment: Business Goals and System Design](#15-6-strategic-alignment-business-goals-and-system-design) | Key topic in this chapter's Core Concepts reading. |\n| [15.7 Risks of Poor Information Strategy](#15-7-risks-of-poor-information-strategy) | Key topic in this chapter's Core Concepts reading. |\n| [15.8 The Grading Database as a Strategic System](#15-8-the-grading-database-as-a-strategic-system) | Key topic in this chapter's Core Concepts reading. |\n| [15.9 Integration & Looking Ahead](#15-9-integration-and-looking-ahead) | Key topic in this chapter's Core Concepts reading. |\n| [Chapter Summary](#chapter-summary) | Key topic in this chapter's Core Concepts reading. |\n| [Table of Figures](#table-of-figures) | Key topic in this chapter's Core Concepts reading. |\n\n---",
    "pageNumber": 1,
    "totalPages": 1,
    "chapterId": "ch15",
    "chapterSlug": "ch15-business-strategy-is",
    "sectionId": "ch15-introduction",
    "sectionSlug": "introduction",
    "sectionTitle": "Introduction",
